                                                "sense_id": "8daf993e-ef8b-36eb-a1c8-f9ed97980bbe",
                                                "text": "Scientifically, there's nothing special about the year 2012."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "14343b7f-832b-46f8-b26c-aea28f00991a",
                                                "sense_id": "8daf993e-ef8b-36eb-a1c8-f9ed97980bbe",
                                                "text": "I remembered the old doctor, - ‘It would be interesting for science to watch the mental changes of individuals, on the spot.’ I felt I was becoming scientifically interesting."
